          },
          "object_ref": "ONX_JDP_IID_CONTEXT_obj_40d6ed3502",
          "object": {
            "definition": "Contexts $x_t$ are i.i.d. from an unknown distribution $P$. The finite action set $\\mathcal A$ and feature map $\\phi$ are public. The fixed unknown parameter and features lie in the Euclidean unit ball: $$\\|\\phi(x,a)\\|_2\\le1,\\quad\\|\\theta_\\star\\|_2\\le1,\\quad Y_t\\in[-1,1],\\quad\\mathbb E[Y_t\\mid x_t,a_t,\\mathcal H_{t-1}]=\\langle\\phi(x_t,a_t),\\theta_\\star\\rangle.$$ Rewards are fresh draws from the current conditional law. The learner observes the context, selects an action, and then receives that action's reward. $$d_{\\mathcal A}=\\max_x\\dim\\operatorname{span}\\{\\phi(x,a):a\\in\\mathcal A\\}\\le\\min\\{d,|\\mathcal A|\\}.$$",
            "id": "ONX_JDP_IID_CONTEXT_obj_40d6ed3502",
            "type": "online_environment"
          },
          "operation_ref": "ONX_JDP_IID_CONTEXT_ora_7ce0a0431d",
          "operation": {
            "access_schedule_ref": "ONX_JDP_IID_CONTEXT_pro_7703562dd3",
            "cost_rule_ref": "ONX_JDP_IID_CONTEXT_res_664d76d43b",
            "display_label_zh": "Scalar reward of the selected action",
            "domain_ref": "ONX_JDP_IID_CONTEXT_dom_0c72e368b9",
            "feedback_quality": {
              "feedback": "x_t then selected bounded reward; known feature map"
            },
            "id": "ONX_JDP_IID_CONTEXT_ora_7ce0a0431d",
            "operation_code": "selected_reward",
            "query_signature": "Causal policies must satisfy $(\\epsilon_{\\mathrm{priv}},\\delta_{\\mathrm{priv}})$ joint differential privacy. Inputs $T,d,\\mathcal A,\\phi,\\epsilon_{\\mathrm{priv}},\\delta_{\\mathrm{priv}}$ are public; context distribution $P$ and reward parameter $\\theta_\\star$ are hidden. Exact planning and regression subroutines are allowed. Received feedback may be stored and reused computationally. No unrevealed historical information or extra queries to exhausted samples are available; any within-round full-function or common-sample access must be explicit.",
            "response_signature": {
              "feedback": "x_t then selected bounded reward; known feature map"
            },
            "target_object": "ONX_JDP_IID_CONTEXT_obj_40d6ed3502"
          },
